  "description": "Auction house for SetNet: list items (escrowed from inventory), bid or buy out (currency escrowed, prior bidder refunded), and a background timer settles expired listings — winner gets the item, seller gets the bid, or the item is returned. All moves go through SetNet.Inventory + SetNet.Wallet (no dupes). server.UseAuction(inventory, wallet) + client.UseAuction(). Depends on SetNet + SetNet.Inventory + SetNet.Wallet.",
